	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia filii dei tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Audio te occupatum, optime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, in paranda apologia ad<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>versum <persName ref="p458">Brencii</persName> calumnias impiumque dogma ubiquitatis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Macte constantiam, et benignus deus te <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>suo spiritu roboret, quo, ut cępisti, Christi gloriam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ex luculenta et impia doctrina vindicetur, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quod futurum spero brevi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Illorum siquidem stultitia, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ne dicam pertinacia, omnibus bonis luce <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>clarius patet, neque suis sycophantiis electis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>imponent, qui veritate imbuti intelligunt sane, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quid <persName>Huldrychus <span type="pronoun">ille</span> Encaustius</persName> cum suis asseclis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in ecclesia ambiat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">O deus, o filii dei <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>obstrue impudentum ora, qui sua<foreign xml:lang="el">λογομαχία</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>student (tametsi frustra) tuam maiestatem extenua<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>re etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> <persName>Novatiani</persName> illi pergunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>In Christi natalitio nemo ex senatoribus, nemo <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ex civibus communicavit, tantum quidem aulici et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qui rerum potiuntur, numero sedecim.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Idem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>factum <placeName>Hunavillę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fremunt et rumpuntur prope<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>modum cęremoniastę, grandia minitantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>D. <persName ref="p8088">Nicolaum Regium</persName> (puto te non ignorare) facta <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>egregia confessione me pręsente et d. <persName>Rapoltsteinens<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>e</persName> cum matre et familia die decima decembris meridie <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>magna patientia posuisse animam<note type="misc">Niklaus König 10. Dez. 1561.; Erb an Hb 23. Dez. 1561 / Bopp Nr. 2853</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sepultus est <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in sacello arcis, quod purgatum a superstitionibus ab <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>octo annis non habuit sacrificum, idque pręsentibus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ipso hero, tum et nobilibus non sine quorundam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>lachrymis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Inviderunt hunc honorem fideli dei mini<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>stro cęremoniastę.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Feci ego epitaphium quod <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>pendet a pariete etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p8111">Petri Martyris</persName> dialogum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>vertendo iam dudum absolvissem; sed cum uxor mea <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>graviter adhuc decumbat, more testudineo <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>promovi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Simulac versus fuerit, mittam, hac <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>conditione tamen, ut tu censor sis, priusquam publicum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>videat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nil novi apud nos, nisi quod milites <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>conscribuntur in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName>, in cuius <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>gratiam, ignoramus; adeo sunt taciti, ut ne gry <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quidem audias.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quosdam principes brevi comitia <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>habituros plerique adfirmant; metuo, ne Germani <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>rursum monstrum alant; tamen dies ista declarabit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Proinde deus cum suo filio Iesu Christo enixissim<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>e exorandus, ut aliquando suo glorioso ad<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ventu conciliabula illorum, qui a veritate paulatim def<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>iciunt, dissipet.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l404">Rapoltsville</placeName> ad lucernam nuntio expectante; alias copiosius.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">23. ianuarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Inprimis pietate eximio ac eruditione d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, antistiti ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName>, d. et fr<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>atri obser<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>vando <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
